opcost_exclusions_yn:
The following will be excluded from Operating Costs:
(i) the costs of repairs or replacements to the Structure of the Leased Premises and the Utility Services, unless the need for such repairs or replacements is caused or made necessary by (i) work performed by or on behalf of the T; (ii) an Event of Default; (iii) the acts, omissions or negligence of any T Party permitted to use or occupy any part of the Leased Premises during the Term and the cost of such maintenance, repairs or replacements is not recovered or recoverable by the LL under the policies of insurance maintained or required to be maintained by the LL; (iv) perils against which the T is required to insure under the Lease or otherwise insures and if the T recovers proceeds with respect to the cost of such repairs; or (v) the application of any Applicable Laws as a result of the business being carried on, at or from the Leased Premises;
(ii) net insurance proceeds received by LL pursuant to insurance that the LL is required to maintain to the extent that the proceeds relate to damage or destruction of any portion of the Leased Premises or any Bldg. System or part thereof;
(iii) net recoveries received by LL under any warranties relating to the repair or replacement of any portion of the Leased Premises or any Bldg. System or part thereof;
(iv) LL's income taxes, Business Taxes, Capital Taxes, large corporation taxes and any other taxes personal to the LL;
(v) any fines, penalties, interest or late payment charges incurred by the LL as a result of the LL's late payment of Realty Taxes or other bills relating to the Leased Premises, save and except where such late payment is as a result of the T's delinquency in payment of Additional Rent on account of such amounts;
(vi) any development or impost charges, unless the same relate directly to a development or improvement made for the benefit of the Leased Premises;
(vii) any rent or other payments pursuant to any ground lease of the Lands; and
(viii) interest, fees and other debt service costs and capital retirement of any financing of the Leased Premises.
(Lease, 1.2)

