A. all net recoveries which reduce Shared Facilities Costs received by the LL from tenants of the Lands as a result of any act, omission, default or negligence of such tenants or by reason of a breach by such tenants of provisions in their respective leases (other than recoveries from such tenants under clauses in their respective leases requiring their contribution to Shared Facilities Costs)
B. net proceeds received by the LL from insurance policies taken out by the LL to the extent that the proceeds relate to Shared Facilities Costs;
C. all net recoveries received by the LL under any warranties relating to the repair or replacement of any portion of the Shared Facilities or any appurtenances, facilities and improvements thereon;
D. any income taxes, corporation taxes, business taxes, profit taxes, capital gains tax, gift taxes, succession taxes, inheritance taxes, place of business taxes, Capital Taxes to the extent not levied in lieu of Realty Taxes, or other taxes personal to the LL except to the extent they are imposed in lieu of or in replacement of any Realty Taxes payable by the T;
E. any fines, penalties, interest or late payment charges incurred by the LL as a result of the LL’s late payment of Realty Taxes or other bills relating to the Shared Facilities, save and except where such late payment is as a result of the T’s delinquency in payment of Additional Rent on account of such amounts;
F. any development or impost charges, unless the same relate directly to a development or improvement made for the benefit of the Leased Lands or the Shared Facilities;
G. any principal, interest, fees, debt service costs or other carrying charges or mortgage payments or other financing costs or the capital retirement of any financing in respect of the Shared Facilities or Lands;
H. any amounts expressly required by this Ground Lease to be paid by the LL; and
I. any cost, charge, imposition, expense or outlay arising directly from the default of the LL under this Ground Lease, from any misrepresentation made by the LL in this Ground Lease, or from the negligence or willful misconduct of the LL.
(Lease, 1.2 )

