repairs_maintenance:
Operating Costs shall include (i) heating, ventilating, air conditioning and humidity control and fire sprinkler maintenance and monitoring, if any, of the Premises; and (ii) maintenance, repair and replacement of the Premises including all structural maintenance, repairs and replacements and all costs of all structures, improvements, furnishings, fixtures, equipment, machinery, systems and facilities constructed or installed in or used in connection with the Premises.
(Lease, 2.16a)

Operating Costs, however, shall exclude repairs or replacements to the extent that the cost of the same is recovered by LL pursuant to original construction warranties.
(Lease, 2.16c)

LL shall perform the following:
-maintenance of the HVAC Units and fire sprinkler maintenance and monitoring, if applicable;
-maintenance, repair and replacement of the Premises including, without limitation, all structural maintenance, repairs and replacements and all maintenance, repairs and replacements to all improvements, furnishings, fixtures, equipment, machinery, systems and facilities constructed or installed in or used in connection with the Premises;
-maintenance, repairs and replacements to the roof of the Bldg.;
-maintenance, repairs and replacements to all asphalt areas of the Premises;
LL's costs of the above shall be included in Operating Costs.
(Lease, 9.7)
